  "title": "Covering by Residue Classes",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Let $N$ be large. For each prime $p$ with $N^{0.51} \\leq p < 2N^{0.51}$, pick a residue $a(p) \\in \\mathbb{Z}/p\\mathbb{Z}$. Is $\\#\\{n \\in [N] : n \\equiv a(p) \\pmod p \\text{ for some } p\\} \\gg N^{1-o(1)}$?",
